# 新增的两个 Gradle 模块 (插件接口 :lwplugin-api 与样例伴侣 :sample-companion) 的构建产物:
# 上面那两条是按路径锚定的, 盖不到它们 —— 样例那一份 build 里还躺着一个 6 MB 的 APK, 进了历史
# 就没法干净地拿掉 (2026-10-09 收 2.6.0 时发现的)
/lwplugin-api/build
/samples/companion/build
# 第三份模块 (鲸鱼娘小组件) 的构建产物: 它是 2026-10-10 那一批加的, 上面那几条按路径锚定的规则
# 一样盖不到它 —— 而它里面躺着 16 MB 的伴侣 APK。
# **2026-10-11 方案 v2 起那一份收进了 archive/samples/whale-widget/** (不再是 Gradle 模块),
# 这一条跟着挪过去: 归档时整目录 `git mv` 把它原来的 build/ 一起带了过去
/archive/samples/whale-widget/build
/captures
.externalNativeBuild
.cxx
*.log
logcat.log
# Kotlin 增量编译的会话戳 (每一次构建都换一个名字), 不是源码
.kotlin/
.vscode/

# The Node runtime and the shared libraries it needs, already patched to
# DT_RUNPATH=$ORIGIN with normalised SONAMEs. They are 109 MiB of prebuilt ELF
# that a Gradle task will fetch (see AGENTS.md), so they stay out of history
/app/src/main/jniLibs/

# The OCR models are build products of the QAIRT toolchain: PP-OCR ONNX from HuggingFace,
# shape-pinned, compiled to a QNN context binary for one Hexagon generation and wrapped for
# ONNX Runtime. 5.9 MiB of them, regenerated by tools/ocr/build-models.ps1 (which wants the
# 1.7 GB QAIRT SDK that ships with B:\Git\Inferencer), so they stay out of history too
/app/src/main/assets/ocr/

# sherpa-onnx AAR 平时由构建任务从上游 Release 取（sha256 写死在 app/build.gradle.kts），
# 离线或用自己编的版本时才放到这里覆盖。36.9 MB 的二进制不进历史
/app/libs/

# docx-preview 打包器第一次跑时 npm install 的依赖 (tools/build-docx-preview.mjs), 产物是 lib/client.js
/presets/docx-preview/.deps/
